{"id":"00226","root":"uni00226_1","name":{"ja":"アンリード・ボニー","en":"Annreed Bonnie"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"アンリード・ボニー","en":"Annreed Bonnie"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-08-16","limited":false,"characterId":167,"profile":{"ja":"魔界で“死神のアンリード”と名を轟かせる魔族のガンマンにして賞金稼ぎ。人間界から流入した科学と、魔界の技術によって生み出された特別なリボルバー拳銃“ジェットリボルバー”が得物で、装甲車にも穴をあけるほどの魔法銃弾を撃つ。体のあちこちに魔繍と呼ばれる魔術的な刺青を施していて、この魔繍のうちいくつかはシュヴァリエが施したもの。魔繍はその力を発動させる時にだけ体に浮かび上がるため、普段その刺青を見る事はできない。彼女が多用している魔繍、例えば“ジャック・ローズ”は太ももに浮かぶ薔薇の刺青で、一定の間、驚異的なスピードをアンリードに与える。","en":"Annreed Bonnie is a demon-world gunslinger and bounty hunter famed as the \"Reaper of Annreed.\" She wields a special revolver pistol, the Jet Revolver, forged from human-world science and demon-world technology, firing magical bullets that can pierce armored vehicles. Her body is marked with mystical tattoos called \"ma-shuu,\" some of which were applied by Chevalier. These tattoos only appear when their power is activated, so they are normally invisible. One of her frequently used ma-shuu, \"Jack Rose,\" manifests as a rose tattoo on her thigh and grants Annreed extraordinary speed for a short time."},"illustrator":"Sian","voiceActor":"高梨はなみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00226_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1188,2376],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[185,370],"def":[121,242],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","280004"]},{"id":"uni00226_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1776,3552],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[295,590],"def":[167,334],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","280004","280005"]},{"id":"uni00226_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2364,4740],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[405,811],"def":[213,424],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","280004","280005","280006"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属